/t/p/w780/2sYjcGccNfjGFDnhuX8NX2ID6Xb.jpg\"},{\"id\":550736,\"name\":\"Aleksandr Grave\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x21tEXhJScJz2lvvS5N1DUiXCvl.jpg\"},{\"id\":125862,\"name\":\"Alexander Adabashyan\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tg4xDyA8U8Snf4xmdxfM0wSithX.jpg\"},{\"id\":238509,\"name\":\"Yelena Semyonova\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1627007,\"name\":\"Roman Kryukov\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AiZ0HkzocKON7yJUP5366d4KidW.jpg\"},{\"id\":2105002,\"name\":\"Andrei Davydov\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uMGFoH2ElBUou4hdLHj4gOeDBof.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":121875,\"title\":\"In the House\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6NCBSCCcyef9aNcABsVGZwuehSC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSlu3MWZzOVBy6e6UEw9mPLMzUO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sixteen-year-old boy insinuates himself into the house of a fellow student from his literature class and writes about it in essays for his French teacher. Faced with this gifted and unusual pupil, the teacher rediscovers his enthusiasm for his work, but the boy’s intrusion will unleash a series of uncontrollable events.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":480001,\"title\":\"The Art of Self-Defense\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bTq793Qwl3tCXb94zrDPAwppbsC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cUkpSTVt0iUbIVFDxvUGs747OMW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Casey is attacked at random on the street and enlists in a local dojo led by a charismatic and mysterious Sensei in an effort to learn how to defend himself. What he uncovers is a sinister world of fraternity, violence and hypermasculinity and a woman fighting for her place in it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":385332,\"title\":\"Terminal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xi7pA3lL6Wb78p6Y6PgWoHDMjrM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8K5S5W0te4FJ0GVRHcPYPETWwLA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives.  Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1144911,\"title\":\"Skincare\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ikPzv7el0RcBhtXj3ElCoH54icd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cxDae3pWJf2D8LMeRRaaE9zoYK7.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Famed aesthetician Hope Goldman is about to take her career to the next level by launching her very own skin care line. However, she soon faces a new challenge when a rival opens a boutique directly across from her store. Suspecting that someone is trying to sabotage her, she embarks on a quest to unravel the mystery of who's trying to destroy her life.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":376453,\"title\":\"Operation Avalanche\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ngw7s1fa0eJL19fJ6Jw0bTQg3n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wsrzZigEWtohP7vUVVgX8sVKiDV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1967, four undercover CIA agents were sent to NASA posing as a documentary film crew. What they discovered led to one of the biggest conspiracies in American history.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61537,\"title\":\"Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wgQuP4qrsjw4kNgR3sYQeaCNllm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpYER5hPpg1NHki8EVmcDeWi1vs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we've come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam's last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the \\\"Espada Ardiente\\\" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he'd imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic's doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":915831,\"title\":\"Monica, O My Darling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GvYW5pQPSw4gxSLBnOkXF2bZbf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szov0Tr05mP7rKHlG2VYyWh33wx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A slick robotics expert joins a murderous plot after a passionate affair takes a sudden turn, but nothing — not even death — is what it seems to be.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12487,\"title\":\"Gozu\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mo5L0XzMYmLhdsvgA40qlYiHhAF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wrV17pXZjFnnUtdGYZaz9q7mslR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Minami mistakenly kills a gangster associate of his named Brother. Almost as soon as the murder takes place, the body of the deceased man is gone, prompting Minami to conduct a search. While looking, he finds a mysterious isolated hotel where he decides to take a rest. Not only are the front desk clerks a bit strange, but even the ambiance feels unusual. Minami soon realizes he may have gotten more than he bargained for.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":938250,\"title\":\"Club Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9BPVGkU51kUWk54YJl2BXDEdl9y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z0cYoSjZ1sH9oKBDhJeQxlxIYh.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Miss Novak joins the staff of an international boarding school to teach a conscious eating class and forms a strong bond with five students that eventually takes a dangerous turn.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Z2HQrKx6vcE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"achXKI9Cxcg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ryuH9zhbqQ0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}